{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30239","headline":"送司徒相公赴阙 · 薛逢","name":"送司徒相公赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相衔恩赴阙时，锦城寒菊始离披。\n龙媒旧识朝天路，鸡树长虚入梦枝。\n十载殿廷连步武，雨来庸蜀抚疲羸。\n莫愁中土无人识，自有明明圣主知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}